107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 83 0 R
/E (Outcome based goals \(wanting a number on the scale\) are fragile and don't paint the whole picture... they can be hit or missed and give you no instructions for the next day if/when the goal is achieved. Identity based goals \("I'm someone who trains, regardless of how the day or week's gone"\) survive a bad week, because the goal was never about that one week, it was about showing up regardless of emotion and not derailing.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
