116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (A pre-decided "if this, then that" plan removes the decision from the moment you're least equipped to make it well, reducing 'decision fatigue'. This is the same principle behind implementation intentions used in behaviour change research: deciding in advance, in calm conditions, removes the need to negotiate with the 'weaker version' of yourself in the moment.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
